{"id":"397646854","kind":"article","title":"间隔重复卡片通常是原子化的，而助记媒介为其赋予结构","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5YjgWTaYfhWLrEbysgmDfFRcZ1yxgLeBeZac","https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8e98xn7t5QNHr5cf8oqjbJ"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2021-08-09","updated":"2024-09-11","votes":11,"comment_count":8,"minutes":1,"chars":491,"keywords":["助记媒介","间隔重复","卡片设计","知识组织","概念理解"],"summary":"作者认为，孤立的间隔重复卡片缺少整体脉络，而助记媒介把卡片嵌入散文叙述，可为其提供结构和目的，帮助读者在上下文中组织理解并建立个人联系。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/397646854","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"k9g9rbUK\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z1YhDPWyvzzkC79LFcF4DSTanKpEGpic8bAe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">单独的间隔重复记忆卡片是一种糟糕的交流媒介</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，但<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4rRX3qwSSJRsEkdXKwH2shamgHNeRthrMLiF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>通过将卡片嵌入到散文叙述中，赋予卡片以秩序，并将其嵌入一个更大的整体。上下文使读者能够以一种创作的、结构化的方式建立理解。叙述也给了卡片一个更显著的目的，这很重要，因为<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5gCpoFJJThDFHK1a7Vv3ssxF3kkjeRaTrJHK\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">深刻的理解需要强烈的个人联系（也是其结果）</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"JvE9KOmA\">也可参见「我们如何才能开发出变革性的思想技术？」中《<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://numinous.productions/ttft/#expanding-memory-system-scope\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">扩展记忆系统的使用范围：还可以用于哪些类型的理解？</a>》<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>一节的讨论。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"nF7lAQHf\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"396775375\" href=\"#/post/396775375\">单独的间隔重复记忆卡片是一种糟糕的交流媒介</a></li><li data-pid=\"7rSL1ShK\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"408715726\" href=\"#/post/408715726\">我的间隔重复系统方法的不同之处</a></li><li data-pid=\"5F7zEtmR\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">助记媒介 (Mnemonic medium)</a></li><li data-pid=\"FLXTHWO2\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"487321909\" href=\"#/post/487321909\">助记媒介可以扩展到个人笔记上</a></li><li data-pid=\"3N-HqOL9\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"565182669\" href=\"#/post/565182669\">概念型知识的「最优复习间隔」可能更长</a></li><li data-pid=\"A53PtMhJ\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"719498216\" href=\"#/post/719498216\">程序教学</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"gbdOim4w\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"bum2lXK9\"><a class=\"member_mention\" data-hash=\"3c9990a12cdbcd92e20b1387b160f0a3\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$3c9990a12cdbcd92e20b1387b160f0a3\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/JarrettYe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5YjgWTaYfhWLrEbysgmDfFRcZ1yxgLeBeZac\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">The mnemonic medium gives structure to normally-atomized spaced repetition memory prompts</a></blockquote><p></p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 单独的间隔重复记忆卡片是一种糟糕的交流媒介 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"396775375\" href=\"#/post/396775375\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 助记媒介 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 深刻的理解需要强烈的个人联系（也是其结果） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"397575334\" href=\"#/post/397575334\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 我们如何才能开发出变革性的思想工具？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"394795804\" href=\"#/post/394795804\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"395283887","title":"穿越时间的文本","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":30,"minutes":8,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"409992579","title":"助记媒介可能通过提供作者创作的卡片来辅助卡片编写","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"487321909","title":"助记媒介可以扩展到个人笔记上","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":17,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"459483765","title":"助记媒介（Mnemonic medium）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":37,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"396775375","title":"单独的间隔重复记忆卡片是一种糟糕的交流媒介","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":13,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"274891979","title":"通用描述符","author":"RemNote","votes":29,"minutes":4,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「卡片设计」· RemNote"}],"rec_answers":[]}